ject\n  originSessionId: acab57a5-067a-4a1b-b5bb-257976113aa0\n  modified: 2026-10-30T21:16:23.011Z\n---\n\nTraps in the NeuriCo paper-writing stage (seen 2026-10-30, embedding_collapse_repetition run):\n- `\\usepackage[final]{neurips_2025}` sets no track, so `\\@trackname` is undefined at `\\maketitle`. Keep the mandated line and add `\\makeatletter\\providecommand{\\@trackname}{}\\makeatother` after it.\n- `commands/general.tex` renews `\\algorithmicindent`, so load `algpseudocode` before `\\input{commands/general}`.\n- `paper_examples/` may hold only a README; style then comes from `templates/paper_writing/`.\n- REPORT.md references \"from memory\" can be wrong (venues, years, author names), and summary counts can count ties or significance as strict wins. Check citations online and recompute counts from `results/*.csv`.\n\n**Why:** each cost a debugging step, and the wrong citations would have reached the paper.\n**How to apply:** do these checks before drafting. See also [[neurico-host-local-llm-fallback]].\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01H4sE9ZeZe9Mm4jpHKGePTp","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
