{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MhxiCMytzxaAH3WSVbHWNo","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Peeperkorn \"Is Temperature the Creativity Parameter of Large Language Models?\" ICCC 2024 authors\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Is Temperature the Creativity Parameter of Large Language Models?\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.00492\"},{\"title\":\"arxiv.org\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.00492v1\"},{\"title\":\"Max Peeperkorn, Dan Brown and colleagues Tom Kouwenhoven and Anna Jordanous receive Best Student Paper Award at ICCC’24\",\"url\":\"https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/computer-science/news/max-peeperkorn-dan-brown-tom-kouwenhoven-anna-jordanous-receive-best-student-paper-award-iccc24\"},{\"title\":\"Max Peeperkorn, Dan Brown and colleagues Tom Kouwenhoven and Anna Jordanous receive Best Student Paper Award at ICCC’24\",\"url\":\"https://uwaterloo.ca/computer-science/news/max-peeperkorn-dan-brown-tom-kouwenhoven-anna-jordanous-receive-best-student-paper-award-iccc24\"},{\"title\":\"kar.kent.ac.uk\",\"url\":\"https://kar.kent.ac.uk/105743/\"},{\"title\":\"We gratefully acknowledge support from\",\"url\":\"https://export.arxiv.org/abs/2405.00492\"},{\"title\":\"max peeperkorn dan brown tom kouwenhoven anna jordanous receive best student paper award iccc24\",\"url\":\"https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/news/max-peeperkorn-dan-brown-tom-kouwenhoven-anna-jordanous-receive-best-student-paper-award-iccc24\"},{\"title\":\"ICCC24 paper 70\",\"url\":\"https://computationalcreativity.net/iccc24/papers/ICCC24_paper_70.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"alphaxiv.org\",\"url\":\"https://alphaxiv.org/overview/2405.00492v1\"},{\"title\":\"Is Temperature the Creativity Parameter of Large Language Models?\",\"url\":\"https://cs.paperswithcode.com/paper/is-temperature-the-creativity-parameter-of\"}]\n\nThe paper is by **Max Peeperkorn, Tom Kouwenhoven, Dan Brown, and Anna Jordanous**. Their affiliations are the University of Kent, Leiden University, and the University of Waterloo. It is listed as \"To be published in the Proceedings of the 15th International Conference on Computational Creativity (ICCC'24)\", and it is also on arXiv as 2405.00492.\n\nIt was presented in June 2024 at Jönköping University in Sweden, and the team received a Best Student Paper Award for the work.\n\nOn findings, the authors report that temperature has a weak link to novelty and no link to cohesion or typicality. Their overall conclusion is that the effect of temperature on creativity is more limited than the \"creativity parameter\" label implies (arXiv abstract, 1-5 and 1-6).\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a867cf8-27b7-4a02-a79a-db20ed0dcd08","uuid":"63c827a8-b1c1-4e6b-bcb5-6a5e46222b5c","timestamp":"2026-10-30T22:14:32.296Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Peeperkorn \"Is Temperature the Creativity Parameter of Large Language Models?\" ICCC 2024 authors","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Gtzp7f9UeL2ZXwKQMu9LrX","content":[{"title":"Is Temperature the Creativity Parameter of Large Language Models?","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.00492"},{"title":"arxiv.org","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.00492v1"},{"title":"Max Peeperkorn, Dan Brown and colleagues Tom Kouwenhoven and Anna Jordanous receive Best Student Paper Award at ICCC’24","url":"https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/computer-science/news/max-peeperkorn-dan-brown-tom-kouwenhoven-anna-jordanous-receive-best-student-paper-award-iccc24"},{"title":"Max Peeperkorn, Dan Brown and colleagues Tom Kouwenhoven and Anna Jordanous receive Best Student Paper Award at ICCC’24","url":"https://uwaterloo.ca/computer-science/news/max-peeperkorn-dan-brown-tom-kouwenhoven-anna-jordanous-receive-best-student-paper-award-iccc24"},{"title":"kar.kent.ac.uk","url":"https://kar.kent.ac.uk/105743/"},{"title":"We gratefully acknowledge support from","url":"https://export.arxiv.org/abs/240